        "text_T4dTBP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The fragrance world has a real problem with fakes. Some look almost perfect on the outside, but the scent fades in an hour and can even irritate your skin. We know how frustrating it is to spend good money and end up with a copy, which is exactly why we are so strict about where our stock comes from.</p><p>Everything we sell is sourced from <strong>established, verified distributors</strong> in the fragrance industry. We do not buy from random resellers, we do not chase suspiciously cheap deals and we never cut corners to hit a lower price.</p>"
          }
        },
        "heading_qTnKaR": {
