        },
        "text_NEk4Df": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A lower price can make people nervous, and that is fair. The answer is simple. We buy at wholesale and run a lean shop online, so we skip the rent, staff and advertising costs that push retail prices up. The juice inside the bottle is the same one you would find at a luxury counter. You are just not paying for the counter.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_QdPKWp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Still unsure? Do not just take our word for it. Hundreds of real customers have shared their experience, and many of them mention checking their bottles themselves. Have a look at what they have to say, and if you ever have a question about a specific product, reach out and we will happily walk you through it.</p>"
